        "original_id": "2976bb1c-c1e2-5680-aef0-56d98a8387c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Chadwick\n- Companies: Game Designers' Workshop, GDW, SFC Press\n- Products: En Garde!, A House Divided\n- Topics: game design, publishing, postal games, magazines, game events\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Chadwick is an American multiple-award-winning game designer and a New York Times best-selling author.\n- Game Designers' Workshop, also called GDW, first published En Garde! in 1975.\n- Frank Chadwick designed En Garde!.\n- SFC Press was a UK games company that published En Garde!.\n- SFC Press ran postal games, published the magazine Games Games Games, and ran games events.\n- Frank Chadwick designed A House Divided.\n- Game Designers Workshop released A House Divided in 1981.",
